@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "牙医" as A0
boundary "<u>:牙医接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:记录复诊随访评</u>\n<u>估控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:诊后要求</u>" as Followup
participant "<u>:就诊</u>" as Visit
participant "<u>:临床评估</u>" as Assessment
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-14办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-14办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Followup : 核对评估责任(牙医与来源)
activate Followup
Followup --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Followup
opt 评估依据包含实际复诊
K -> Visit : 提供本次复诊依据(同患者就诊或沟通来源)
activate Visit
Visit --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Visit
end
K -> Followup : 确认临床评估(结果、处理意见、后续日期)
activate Followup
Followup -> Assessment : 保留评估依据(实际方式、人员时间)
activate Assessment
Assessment --> Followup : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Assessment
Followup -> Followup : 判断完成或继续(是否仍需评估及跟进)
Followup --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Followup
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Assessment
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
